<http://data.silknow.org/object/26e3ce1a-a5bc-3830-997d-d76c5c2fb396/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Brocaded in tinsel, silver wire wound on a silk core, frisé silver yarn and polychrome silks on a rose colored figured silk ground.  In the center, a wavy ribbon-like motif with large floral sprays in silver and silks slanting alternately to right and left.  On each side, a zig-zag border in silver with small single flowers.  Composed of two pieces.  Selvedge on one side of four cords and a narrow stripe.  Very soiled, stained, faded, worn.  Silver tarnished."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/26e3ce1a-a5bc-3830-997d-d76c5c2fb396> .

